---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ScholarLedger from '../../../components/treatise/ScholarLedger.astro';
import ManuscriptLightbox from '../../../components/treatise/ManuscriptLightbox.astro';
import chaptersData from '../../../data/shirk-endorsed/chapters.json';

const coreChapters = chaptersData.filter((c) => c.category === 'core');
const imamsChapters = chaptersData.filter((c) => c.category === 'four-imams');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shirk: Endorsed By The Scholars of Islam | Critical Research Edition"
  description="A 10-century evidentiary critical edition documenting the classical Sunni consensus on Tawassul, Tashaffuʿ, and Istighāthah across 99 major scholars and all four madhhab founders."
>
  <div class="treatise-index-page">
    <!-- Hero / Frontispiece -->
    <section class="treatise-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="hc-eyebrow">Digital Critical Edition & Archival Register</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Shirk: Endorsed By The <em>Scholars of Islam.</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">
            An evidentiary investigation into the theology of <em>Tawassul</em> (seeking intercession), <em>Tashaffuʿ</em>, and <em>Istighāthah</em> (seeking aid) across ten centuries of Sunni scholarship—examining the irreconcilable tension between modern Salafi-Wahhabi anathema and the historical consensus of classical orthodoxy.
          </p>

          <!-- Metrics Ledger -->
          <div class="metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-val">10</span>
              <span class="metric-lbl">Centuries of Continuity (4th–14th AH)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-val">4</span>
              <span class="metric-lbl">Sunni Madhhab Founders Endorsing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-val">99</span>
              <span class="metric-lbl">Major Classical Authorities Cited</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
              <span class="metric-val">207</span>
              <span class="metric-lbl">Primary Source Manuscript Scans</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Thesis Abstract & Problem Statement -->
    <section class="thesis-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="thesis-box">
          <div class="thesis-box__header">
            <span class="box-badge">The Central Dilemma</span>
            <h2 class="box-title">The Salafi Dilemma & The Consensus of Orthodoxy</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="thesis-box__body">
            <p>
              Contemporary Salafi authorities (such as Ibn Baz, al-Albani, and Ibn 'Uthaymin), following Muhammad ibn Abd al-Wahhab and select rulings of Ibn Taymiyyah, classify calling upon the Prophet ﷺ for intercession or relief at his grave as <em>Shirk Akbar</em> (major polytheism)—an unforgivable nullifier of Islam that places its practitioner outside the fold of faith without excuse.
            </p>
            <p>
              Yet, a systematic historical examination of the four Sunni schools of jurisprudence (Ḥanafī, Mālikī, Shāfiʿī, and Ḥanbalī) demonstrates that for over a millennium, the leading authorities, exegetes, hadith masters, and jurists unanimously permitted, encouraged, and recorded these very supplications in their standard legal manuals (<em>kutub al-manāsik wa al-fiqh</em>).
            </p>
            <blockquote class="thesis-quote">
              "If seeking intercession through the Prophet is indeed major shirk, then according to strict Salafi logic, the greatest jurists, muftis, and hadith masters of Sunni history were practitioners of idolatry."
            </blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Reading Track -->
    <section class="reading-track-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="hc-eyebrow">Reading Track</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">The Developed Argument</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">
            Follow the structured monograph from foundational hadith analyses through legal theory and the verdicts of the four Sunni Imams.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="chapters-grid">
          <!-- Part I -->
          <div class="part-column">
            <h3 class="part-header">Part I: Foundational Studies</h3>
            <div class="chapter-cards">
              {coreChapters.map((c, i) => (
                <a href={`/research/shirk-endorsed/${c.id}`} class="chapter-card">
                  <span class="chapter-num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                  <div class="chapter-info">
                    <h4 class="chapter-title">{c.title}</h4>
                    <span class="chapter-action">Read chapter →</span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Part II -->
          <div class="part-column">
            <h3 class="part-header">Part II: The Four Sunni Imams</h3>
            <div class="chapter-cards">
              {imamsChapters.map((c, i) => (
                <a href={`/research/shirk-endorsed/${c.id}`} class="chapter-card chapter-card--gold">
                  <span class="chapter-num">0{i + 1}</span>
                  <div class="chapter-info">
                    <h4 class="chapter-title">{c.title}</h4>
                    <span class="chapter-action">Read ruling & text →</span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive 99-Scholar Ledger -->
    <div class="wrap">
      <ScholarLedger />
    </div>
  </div>

  <ManuscriptLightbox />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .treatise-index-page {
    background: var(--hc-surface-0, #0c0c0d);
    color: var(--hc-text-primary, #f5f2eb);
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .treatise-hero {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hc-rule, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(200, 167, 85, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 54rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--hc-text-secondary, #b5b0a5);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  /* Metrics */
  .metrics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .metric-card {
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--hc-surface-1, #141416);
    border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .metric-val {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .metric-lbl {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--hc-text-secondary, #a8a5a0);
    font-family: var(--font-ui, sans-serif);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Thesis Box */
  .thesis-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .thesis-box {
    background: var(--hc-surface-1, #141416);
    border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule-strong, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3));
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .thesis-box__header {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .box-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(200, 167, 85, 0.15);
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-ui, sans-serif);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .box-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--hc-text-primary, #f5f2eb);
  }

  .thesis-box__body p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--hc-text-secondary, #dcd8cf);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .thesis-quote {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
    background: rgba(200, 167, 85, 0.04);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--hc-text-primary, #f5f2eb);
  }

  /* Reading Track */
  .reading-track-section {
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--hc-text-primary, #f5f2eb);
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--hc-text-secondary, #b5b0a5);
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .chapters-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .part-header {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hc-rule, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1));
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .chapter-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .chapter-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--hc-surface-1, #141416);
    border: 1px solid var(--hc-rule, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .chapter-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--hc-rule-strong, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4));
    background: var(--hc-surface-2, #18181b);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .chapter-card--gold {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
  }

  .chapter-num {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .chapter-info {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .chapter-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display, serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--hc-text-primary, #f5f2eb);
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .chapter-action {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--hc-text-tertiary, #858077);
    font-family: var(--font-ui, sans-serif);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .chapter-card:hover .chapter-action {
    color: var(--hc-gold, #c8a755);
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .metrics-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .chapters-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
